WEBVTT

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:11.210
Alarm

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:11.210
Snooze

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:11.210
Cancel

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.750
(Temporary), huh?

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:24.080
Fine. I'll allow you to join RAS.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:28.580
However, you are merely our (temporary) guitarist.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:32.880
A temp...

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:38.920
What exactly is that s'posed to mean...?

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:42.380
Hello?

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:44.580
Get over here pronto, Rokka Asahi!

00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:45.710
CHU2-san?

00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:48.830
(Temporary) or not, you are a member of this band.

00:00:48.830 --> 00:00:51.420
And when I say pronto, that means NOW!

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.540
This early...?

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:08.290
Searching

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:08.290
Archive...

00:01:08.290 --> 00:01:09.380
Image on File

00:01:08.290 --> 00:01:09.380
Rokka Asahi

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:12.710
Good morning!

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:14.500
Good morning.

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:28.040
Good morning!

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:30.790
CHU2-sama, your room service has arrived.

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:32.540
Not now.

00:01:34.540 --> 00:01:36.130
Rokka Asahi...

00:01:39.290 --> 00:01:40.790
Here, use this.

00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:42.290
That guitar...

00:01:42.290 --> 00:01:43.750
C'mon, hurry up!

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:46.080
Oh, but mine is...

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:49.960
I have no interest in wasting my time
with a guitar that gets treated like a pet.

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:53.210
With this, you won't have to worry.
Focus on mimicking our style.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:55.290
CHU2-san...

00:01:56.920 --> 00:01:59.500
Now that I've made myself clear,
show us your waist.

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:00.830
M-my waist?!

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:03.540
We need your measurements.
For the MV costumes.

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:04.710
MV...?

00:02:04.710 --> 00:02:06.080
The music video!

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:07.880
Music video...

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:08.540
Oh, there's no need to take off your clothes.
Music video...

00:02:08.540 --> 00:02:10.080
Oh, there's no need to take off your clothes.

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:10.710
Huh?

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:12.080
My tablet has a special program just for this!

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:13.250
PAREO!

00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:15.670
Can you turn to the side, please?

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:17.000
S-sure.

00:02:18.790 --> 00:02:22.630
This weekend, we're filming
a promotional MV for RAISE A SUILEN.

00:02:23.170 --> 00:02:24.540
Face the back this time.

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:25.880
O-okay.

00:02:25.880 --> 00:02:28.790
The plan is to upload it
on the contest's official website.

00:02:29.380 --> 00:02:30.460
Done!

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:33.420
Which is why I've written a brand-new song.

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:34.580
A new song?!

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:37.170
CHU2-sama has taken care of
the music, lyrics, and arrangement.

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:39.380
I'll send you the sheet music and backing track.

00:02:39.960 --> 00:02:41.790
All by herself?!

00:02:42.710 --> 00:02:47.710
Guitar, bass, drums, keyboard,
and the DJ piece, too...?!

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:53.580
You're good at everything, aren't you?

00:02:55.500 --> 00:03:00.130
After we've captured the hearts of the public
with an MV, they'll come to a bunch of our shows!

00:03:00.130 --> 00:03:03.960
CHU2-sama's goal is to expand our fanbase itself!

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:07.380
With each performance,
we're going to reap the ultimate benefits.

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:11.420
I'll do whatever it takes to boost our numbers!

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:15.380
And then... I'm going to beat Roselia
and PoPiPa to a pulp!

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:18.540
Again with the jerky?!

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:20.540
That isn't good for your health, you know.

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:23.250
Guess I'm doin' the squishin' from now on...
Jerky helps get the creative juices flowing!

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:24.460
Are you telling the truth?

00:03:24.460 --> 00:03:25.670
Of course!

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:02.670
Them Lil' Octopus Sausages

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:32.290
Oh no! I forgot all about votin'!

00:05:32.670 --> 00:05:34.170
Let's see...

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:36.380
Click on Galaxy...

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:38.420
There it is!

00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:41.170
What?!

00:05:41.170 --> 00:05:43.080
Why can't I vote?!

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:45.670
You're tellin' me I missed the cutoff?!

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:52.330
The poll is closed.

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:52.330
Votes must be cast within one hour

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:52.330
of a band's performance.

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:52.330
We apologize!

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:51.670
I forgot the audience is s'posed to vote
within an hour after the show!

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:56.170
Please forgive me, PoPiPa...

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:59.170
Better send 'em an apology!

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:02.750
(Temporary) guitarist?

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:04.000
The heck does that mean?

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:06.790
Sounds like Rock is a member of RAS,
at least for now.

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:08.130
Thank goodness!

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:09.460
How exciting!

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:11.880
She also wants to apologize.

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:16.460
Apparently, she wasn't able to
vote for us after the show.

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:16.460
I'M SORRY

00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:18.380
There's no need to worry about that.

00:06:20.290 --> 00:06:22.290
Actually, there is. Look.

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:26.080
Roselia's in first place with 2615 votes,

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:29.040
followed by RAS with 1254.

00:06:30.460 --> 00:06:33.250
And we... only have 83 votes.

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:39.880
Every vote counts, and if we don't take this seriously...
we'll never reach the Budokan.

00:06:56.210 --> 00:06:58.040
Seems to fit you just fine!

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:00.130
Did you sew it yourself?

00:07:00.130 --> 00:07:02.880
No, I've simply made a few minor alterations.

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:05.210
In fact, this costume used to belong to Hana-san.

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:07.170
Tae-senpai?!

00:07:07.750 --> 00:07:09.170
I can't believe it!

00:07:09.670 --> 00:07:10.920
S'up?

00:07:10.920 --> 00:07:12.000
Morning.

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:13.330
Good morning!

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:14.880
Not half bad, eh?

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:16.460
Rokka-chan, you look great!

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:17.630
CHU2-sama!

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:20.460
It's about time for us to head out.

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:27.040
CHU2-san...?

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:29.830
Let's get goin'!

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:35.460
Hop on.

00:07:35.460 --> 00:07:36.880
R-right!

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:44.290
CHU2-sama looks cute even when she's asleep!

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:53.710
W-we're filming here?!

00:07:53.710 --> 00:07:58.330
According to the rumors, any band that films a video
at this studio goes on to become very famous.

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:01.500
I've heard their schedule is booked solid
for the next six months.

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:03.000
Wow...

00:08:03.630 --> 00:08:07.250
We managed to secure a time slot because
CHU2-sama has connections in high places.

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:08.920
Shut up, PAREO.

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:11.460
Let's have a good shoot today.

00:08:11.460 --> 00:08:13.250
Yes, ma'am!

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:15.960
Th-thank you all for your help!

00:08:16.710 --> 00:08:19.540
Dressing Room

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:19.250
M-makeup, too?

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:22.130
Makeup is extremely important, you know.

00:08:22.380 --> 00:08:25.460
To account for the lighting,
we're going to pile it on thick.

00:08:27.170 --> 00:08:29.670
This music video is our chance to shine.

00:08:29.670 --> 00:08:31.420
We've got to look adorable!

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:34.080
The sky's the limit in our pursuit of cuteness!

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:36.670
Hey, can I take this thing off yet?

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:38.130
Not yet.

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:41.380
Showing up on the day of a shoot with sleep lines...

00:08:41.380 --> 00:08:42.830
I can't believe you!

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:46.830
Good to go!

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:50.540
Places, everyone!

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:53.630
We're rolling!

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:55.130
Ready...

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:56.580
Action!

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:15.710
Pretend they're pistols...?

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:17.880
Take aim at the glass and fire.

00:09:17.880 --> 00:09:19.380
With my fingers?

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:20.920
Ready...

00:09:21.130 --> 00:09:22.210
Action!

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:24.330
Bang!

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:25.580
Cut!

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:28.040
Quit being shy!

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:29.210
Be cool!

00:09:29.580 --> 00:09:32.420
Thrust your right hand forward and draw with your left!

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:33.460
O-okay!

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:35.130
Ready... Action!

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:38.750
Bang!

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:43.040
Yes, cut! Good job!

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:44.130
That's a cut!

00:09:44.130 --> 00:09:45.420
Check the gate!

00:09:47.080 --> 00:09:48.790
How come it shattered like that?

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:51.130
It's a prop used especially for filming.

00:09:51.130 --> 00:09:53.170
Rather than glass, it's made of sugar.

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:54.500
Sugar...?

00:09:54.710 --> 00:09:57.460
We'll need to edit Rokka's expression
out of the frame.

00:09:57.460 --> 00:09:59.130
Sorry...

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:01.710
Time for lunch!

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:08.080
Quality fish, for sure!

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:09.380
How can you tell?

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:10.880
I grew up near the sea!

00:10:10.880 --> 00:10:11.790
The sea?

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:12.790
Shall we eat?

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:14.250
S-sure.

00:10:18.040 --> 00:10:19.750
Mighty tasty!

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:21.790
Are you from Nagoya, by any chance?

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:23.790
Gifu, actually.

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:26.210
Though we probably share
some similarities in the way we talk.

00:10:26.210 --> 00:10:27.420
No kidding!

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:29.750
I lived in Nagoya for a while.

00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:31.630
My parents' jobs took us there.

00:10:31.630 --> 00:10:33.670
Oh, really?

00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:36.420
"Look at them lil' octopus sausages!"

00:10:37.210 --> 00:10:38.580
You gettin' enough sleep?

00:10:39.290 --> 00:10:41.290
I thought I'd try to lighten the mood...

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:42.670
How cute!

00:10:42.670 --> 00:10:43.380
Huh?

00:10:43.380 --> 00:10:44.710
Cute, indeed!

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:45.630
What?!

00:10:45.630 --> 00:10:47.420
Hear that? You're "cute."

00:10:47.420 --> 00:10:48.460
Masuki!

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:50.210
CHU2-sama, lunch is ready!

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:51.170
Not now.

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:52.670
Aw, come on!
Um, CHU2-san...

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:56.040
Let me pay you back for lunch...

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:57.380
No problem.

00:10:57.380 --> 00:10:59.500
My mom and dad are the ones
who made the arrangements.

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:02.580
Don't sweat the small stuff.
Just focus on the music video!

00:11:02.880 --> 00:11:04.380
R-right...

00:11:04.880 --> 00:11:08.710
CHU2-sama's parents are
involved in the music industry,

00:11:08.710 --> 00:11:10.460
and they're living overseas at the moment.

00:11:10.670 --> 00:11:13.460
She's been on her own
ever since she started high school.

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:16.000
CHU2-san's in high school?

00:11:16.210 --> 00:11:18.670
As of this fall, she's a second-year.

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:21.380
Since she skipped a couple of grades,
she's actually 13...

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:23.210
...just like me!

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:24.380
Wait, what?!

00:11:24.380 --> 00:11:27.000
You were the first one to join RAS, weren't you?

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:28.130
I sure was!

00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:31.540
Masuki and I ran in the same circles
during our music gig days.

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:33.500
CHU2 scouted us out.

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:36.750
Music gig...

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:41.130
I better start workin' hard, too!

00:11:45.630 --> 00:11:47.210
Looks good!

00:11:47.420 --> 00:11:50.000
That's a wrap on today's shoot!

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:52.170
Thanks, everyone!

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:55.330
Thank you! Thank you! Thank you!

00:11:59.170 --> 00:12:02.710
We're recording the song on Tuesday.
Be sure you've mastered it by then.

00:12:02.710 --> 00:12:03.330
Right!

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:03.960
Gotcha.

00:12:03.960 --> 00:12:05.630
Huh?! Two days from now?!

00:12:05.630 --> 00:12:07.130
Rokka Asahi...

00:12:07.130 --> 00:12:09.170
I will decide whether or not

00:12:09.170 --> 00:12:12.080
to lift your (temporary) status
based on your performance of our new song.

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:14.330
Show me the perfect masterpiece!

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:16.130
Yes, ma'am!

00:12:25.670 --> 00:12:29.040
Everyone else has it down pat already...

00:12:29.710 --> 00:12:32.380
How'd I end up in a band full of geniuses?

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:40.540
Now then, we'll start with a test.

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:44.210
Before recording each of you individually,
we're going to run through it once as a group.

00:12:44.210 --> 00:12:46.080
Sounds great!

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:56.250
No!

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:57.580
Stop.

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:01.290
Once more. From that last part.

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:15.830
Stop!

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:20.540
Rokka Asahi...

00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:23.670
Why do you insist on playing alone?

00:13:26.170 --> 00:13:29.960
At this rate, you're going to end up
(temporary) permanently.

00:13:29.960 --> 00:13:31.540
Let's call it a day.

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:33.830
Hold on a minute, CHU2-sama!

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:37.460
I thought you said today was the last day
to record if we want to finish on time!

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:39.540
Please wait!

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:50.130
What'd I do wrong...?

00:13:50.130 --> 00:13:51.250
Rokka-chan.

00:13:52.460 --> 00:13:53.580
Want some?

00:13:53.580 --> 00:13:55.540
N-no, thank you!

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:56.540
Oh.

00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:58.290
Are you alright?

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:02.830
I'm not sure what to do...

00:14:02.830 --> 00:14:04.420
Let's grab a bite.

00:14:07.420 --> 00:14:09.080
You comin', Rei?

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:11.580
No room for a third, I'm afraid.

00:14:16.630 --> 00:14:19.420
Ramen GINGA

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:19.420
"Ramen GINGA"...?

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:20.460
C'mon.

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:23.210
Huh?! R-ramen isn't my cup of tea...

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:25.920
I mean, people get frustrated with me
because I eat slowly, and...

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:28.880
B-but I suppose there's nothing wrong with ramen!

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:31.960
Order up! Two bowls o' Ginga ramen.

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:34.630
Trust me on this one.

00:14:36.170 --> 00:14:37.500
Let's eat.

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:43.790
The manager of this restaurant is a guitarist, y'know.

00:14:44.790 --> 00:14:47.750
Played in a band called "Death Galaxy"
with my old man.

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:49.750
You mean the owner?!

00:14:49.750 --> 00:14:55.040
DEATH GALAXY

00:14:50.420 --> 00:14:53.170
Death Galaxy...

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:58.750
Seems you been busy
with yer band lately, young lady.

00:14:58.750 --> 00:14:59.670
"Young lady"...?

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:02.080
Gettin' you to come visit ain't an easy task!

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:08.290
Um... I want to apologize for
dragging everyone down.

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:13.670
I tried putting my heart and soul into it
like last time, but...

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:15.790
Same here.

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:19.210
I lose myself in the music
while I'm bangin' out the tunes.

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:21.960
CHU2's always gettin' on my case.

00:15:23.290 --> 00:15:27.710
But until I joined RAS, I'd never had
a place where I could do that.

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:33.500
Take your time.

00:15:33.790 --> 00:15:35.670
Gonna borrow the kitchen, Boss.

00:15:35.670 --> 00:15:36.670
Sure thing.

00:15:39.170 --> 00:15:41.500
You familiar with the young lady's old nickname?

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:44.670
They used to call her "Mad Dog."

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:45.670
Really?

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:49.000
Threw her weight around
every time a band brought her on.

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:51.420
Caused nothin' but trouble back then.

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:53.830
None of 'em lasted long.

00:15:55.960 --> 00:15:58.960
That's when I was scouted by CHU2.

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:08.880
At first, I thought she was a laughable little shrimp.

00:16:09.130 --> 00:16:12.250
But her passion for music is the real deal.

00:16:15.460 --> 00:16:16.460
Here.

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:19.830
A meal fit for a young lady.

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:22.290
Eat what you can.

00:16:23.380 --> 00:16:25.170
Thank you very much!

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:28.540
I know what it's like to be all alone...

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:32.750
Bands are... freakin' awesome!

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:36.630
I want to play with everyone else!

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:43.790
Y'see, Rei and PAREO...

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:47.710
Even when they lose themselves in the music,
I know they're still listenin' to me.

00:16:47.710 --> 00:16:52.130
It's like, their music comes through
loud and clear when I'm in the zone.

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:54.330
Your music is amazin', too.

00:16:54.630 --> 00:16:59.080
Remember: There's no way CHU2 would've let you
join RAS if she thought you'd drag us down.

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:02.330
Right!

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:04.920
Now get out there and
show 'em what you're made of!

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:06.420
I'll try my best!

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:10.880
Please!

00:17:14.330 --> 00:17:16.670
Didn't I tell you we're done for today?

00:17:16.670 --> 00:17:18.670
A few hours isn't going to make a difference.

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:20.460
I'll keep trying until I get it right!

00:17:21.170 --> 00:17:23.080
Please let me play with the others!

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:47.040
CHU2-san

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:50.790
Get over here pronto, Rokka Asahi!

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:53.670
When I say pronto, that means NOW!

00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:56.460
Wait a minute...

00:17:56.460 --> 00:17:57.670
The MV!

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:44.710
Um...

00:19:45.790 --> 00:19:48.500
Sweet! Excellent! Unstoppable!

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:50.290
C'est magnifique!

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:52.170
Come again...?

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:54.250
It means the video was very nice.

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:58.500
I, um... I thought the MV was incredible!

00:19:58.500 --> 00:20:01.670
The finger guns, us inside the boxes...

00:20:01.670 --> 00:20:04.080
The whole thing was so freakin' cool!

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:08.000
Just because a certain scene stands out in your mind
doesn't mean it's the only one that matters.

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:11.790
The whole of an MV is greater than
the sum of its parts.

00:20:11.790 --> 00:20:13.330
Same goes for a band.

00:20:14.170 --> 00:20:16.080
You have a good time, Rokka?

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:17.210
Yes!

00:20:21.630 --> 00:20:24.540
I made them in a hurry this morning,

00:20:24.540 --> 00:20:27.790
so I'm sorry they're not as fancy
as the catering service...

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:30.540
Yay! What wonderfully simple little rice balls!

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:31.830
Thanks!

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:33.040
I'm starving.

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:38.420
These're pretty tasty.

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:42.000
Here you go, CHU2-sama.

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:43.210
Not no-

00:20:52.540 --> 00:20:55.460
You should fill these with jerky next time, LOCK.

00:20:55.460 --> 00:20:56.460
Sure!

00:20:56.750 --> 00:21:01.420
Wait... CHU2-san, how did you know
my nickname's Rock?

00:21:01.420 --> 00:21:03.920
Isn't that what the PoPiPa girls call you?

00:21:03.920 --> 00:21:04.920
No!

00:21:04.920 --> 00:21:09.500
The name I've given you is spelled L-O-C-K, LOCK!

00:21:09.750 --> 00:21:11.330
Like a lock and key!

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:13.790
A name...!

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.210
Then, that means...!

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:18.420
Rokka Asahi...

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:20.540
From this moment forth, I dub thee "LOCK"!

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:23.710
Allow me to welcome you as
an official member of RAISE A SUILEN!

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:29.170
Thank you very much!

00:21:29.170 --> 00:21:32.250
Congratulations! Congratulations!

00:21:32.460 --> 00:21:34.130
Let's keep up the good work.

00:21:34.130 --> 00:21:34.960
Right!

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:37.040
Great news, eh, LOCK?

00:21:37.630 --> 00:21:38.960
Yeah!

00:21:39.210 --> 00:21:42.170
After all this time, we've finally found RAS' guitarist!

00:21:42.790 --> 00:21:43.790
I certainly do know talent when I see it.

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:45.250
Did you enjoy the ramen?
I certainly do know talent when I see it.

00:21:45.250 --> 00:21:47.330
Yes, it was delicious!
You're so cool, CHU2-sama!

00:21:47.330 --> 00:21:48.750
Wanna grab a bowl, Rei?
Bring me my jerky!

00:21:48.750 --> 00:21:51.000
Guess I oughtta know better than to get my hopes up.
Jerky, coming right up!

00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:51.630
Guess I oughtta know better than to get my hopes up.

00:21:51.630 --> 00:21:53.250
Actually, I've eaten there with Hana-chan before.

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:54.460
What?!

00:23:35.290 --> 00:23:37.790
Next Time: PoPi-V!
